{"articleNo":"197590","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=197590&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"AIESEC(국제리더십학생협회) 해외 봉사 참여 학생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.09.06","hit":"5580","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&lt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">AIESEC(국제리더십학생협회) 해외 봉사&nbsp; 참여 학생 모집&gt;</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ 대상 : 금오공대 재학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ 기간 : 겨울방학 중 6주</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○&nbsp; 봉사국가 : 아시아, 유럽, 아프리카, 아메리카 대륙의 127개국</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ 해외 봉사 홍보 오픈부스 기간 : 9월 18일(화) ~ 19일(수) 10시~15시 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 테크노관 앞 분수대 근처</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ 해외 봉사 설명회 : 9월 20일(목) 19시 G701</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○&nbsp;지원방법 : 카카오플러스 친구 \"AIESEC kit\" 검색 or </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><a href=\"https://www.aiesecinkorea.org/signup/\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">https://www.aiesecinkorea.org/signup/</span></a></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">로 지원</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">○ 기타 문의사항 : 해외봉사 부서장</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">☎ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;김정아(010-3738-7946)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/645c95de-1bad-49e7-ade7-a4ef7d585741.jpg\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
